{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01464","headline":"相和歌辞 采菱行 · 刘禹锡","name":"相和歌辞 采菱行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白马湖平秋日光，紫菱如锦彩鸾翔。\n荡舟游女满中央，采菱不顾马上郎。\n争多逐胜纷相向，时转兰桡破轻浪。\n长鬟弱袂动参差，钗影钏文浮荡漾。\n笑语哇咬顾晚晖，蓼花绿岸扣舷归。\n归来共到市桥步，野蔓系船萍满衣。\n家家竹楼临广陌，下有连樯多估客。\n携觞荐芰夜经过，醉踏大堤相应歌。\n屈平祠下沅江水，月照寒波白烟起。\n一曲南音此地闻，长安北望三千里。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01464.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01464","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}